    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into intense first-person combat in this skills-based melee arena fighter. Engage in fast-paced PvP duels that blend expressive movement, strategic resource management, and visceral, anime-style action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Art of Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Block and Counter:</strong> Defend against attacks and punish reckless opponents.  <br></li><li> <strong>Break Defenses:</strong> Use grabs to overcome shields and create openings.  <br></li><li> <strong>Expressive Movement:</strong> Outmaneuver your opponents and maintain control.<br></li><li> <strong>Manage Your Mana:</strong> Build your mana bar to unleash powerful special moves, escape combos, and reduce recovery times.  </li></ul></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combo Based First Person Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain creative attack combinations while using fluid movement to chase your opponent and maintain pressure. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Connect and Compete Online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience online play designed for competitive battles and social fun:  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Rollback Netcode:</strong> Ensures smooth and consistent gameplay.<br></li><li> <strong>Play With Friends:</strong> Challenge your friends or find new rivals in online matchmaking.  <br></li><li> <strong>Spectator Features:</strong> Watch live battles, cheer for players, and study strategies between matches.</li></ul></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into intense first-person combat in this skills-based melee arena fighter. Engage in fast-paced PvP duels that blend expressive movement, strategic resource management, and visceral, anime-style action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Art of Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Block and Counter:</strong> Defend against attacks and punish reckless opponents.  <br></li><li> <strong>Break Defenses:</strong> Use grabs to overcome shields and create openings.  <br></li><li> <strong>Expressive Movement:</strong> Outmaneuver your opponents and maintain control.<br></li><li> <strong>Manage Your Mana:</strong> Build your mana bar to unleash powerful special moves, escape combos, and reduce recovery times.  </li></ul></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combo Based First Person Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain creative attack combinations while using fluid movement to chase your opponent and maintain pressure. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Connect and Compete Online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience online play designed for competitive battles and social fun:  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Rollback Netcode:</strong> Ensures smooth and consistent gameplay.<br></li><li> <strong>Play With Friends:</strong> Challenge your friends or find new rivals in online matchmaking.  <br></li><li> <strong>Spectator Features:</strong> Watch live battles, cheer for players, and study strategies between matches.</li></ul></p>",
